    "title": "se, Passive and Nominalisation",
    "subtitle": "the values of se, passive reflexive vs impersonal, formal passive, nominalisation and light-verb collocations",
    "footer": "Spanish Learning Program · C1 · Grammar · se, passive, nominalisation",
